# Infernal Rage — a "Play Deck" folder deck installed by Duels of the Planeswalkers (1998): a ready-made
# player deck that shipped in the expansion's files but was not offered in-game (the precon
# page: "users would need to open the game's files and move them into a different directory").
# designer: Tim McCracken (MicroProse, largely the Quality Assurance team — precon page)
# colours: R
